<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Extension Rejected</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        .header { background: #dc3545; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
        .content { padding: 20px; background: #f8f9fa; }
        .rejected { background: #f8d7da; border: 1px solid #f5c6cb; padding: 15px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 5px; }
        .footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px; color: #666; font-size: 12px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>❌ Extension Rejected</h1>
        </div>
        
        <div class="content">
            <h2>Deadline Extension Rejected</h2>
            
            <div class="rejected">
                <strong>❌ REJECTED:</strong> Your deadline extension request has been rejected.
            </div>
            
            <h3>Request Details:</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Request ID:</strong> {{request.id}}</li>
                <li><strong>Description:</strong> {{request.description}}</li>
                <li><strong>Status:</strong> {{request.status}}</li>
            </ul>
            
            <h3>Extension Details:</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Requested Days:</strong> {{extension.requestedDays}}</li>
                <li><strong>Reason:</strong> {{extension.reason}}</li>
                <li><strong>Rejection Date:</strong> {{extension.respondedAt}}</li>
                {{#if extension.rejectionReason}}
                <li><strong>Rejection Reason:</strong> {{extension.rejectionReason}}</li>
                {{/if}}
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>What This Means:</strong></p>
            <ul>
                <li>Your extension request has been denied</li>
                <li>The original deadline remains unchanged</li>
                <li>The request has been marked as failed</li>
                <li>Your project has been archived</li>
                <li>The requester's deposit has been refunded</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>Impact:</strong></p>
            <ul>
                <li>Your reputation score may be affected</li>
                <li>You will not receive payment for this request</li>
                <li>The project is no longer accessible for editing</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>Next Steps:</strong></p>
            <ol>
                <li>Review your time management practices</li>
                <li>Consider requesting extensions earlier in future</li>
                <li>Focus on completing future requests on time</li>
                <li>Look for new translation opportunities</li>
            </ol>
            
            <p>We encourage you to learn from this experience and improve your deadline management for future translation requests.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p>This is an automated message from HereToTranslate</p>
            <p>Please do not reply to this email</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
